	"data": "<!-- scanner: tagged active/ongoing but not updated in 104d — review -->\n\nW6: Speaker Recognition for Hearth\n\nGoal\nIdentify who is speaking to Hearth and route responses differently based on speaker identity. Primary use case: wake-word speaker priority — if cithoreal speaks, Hearth responds; if a guest speaks, Hearth still responds but differently.\n\ncithoreal's Vision (from audio journals)\n\"The big really really cool useful thing\"\nNuanced: not just identification, but priority and…",
